        "text": "Multiple drones with different functions can be dispatched simultaneously, including fire extinguishing, vital signs detection, and supply transport.\n\nDrones connect via IoT, transmitting data to a central platform for AI and manual analysis.\n\nAI identifies fire sources, plans paths, and optimizes algorithms to improve efficiency.\n\nDrones have great potential in reconnaissance, firefighting, and rescue operations."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:4258",
        "text": "Drones arrive quickly and collect fire data via cameras and sensors.\n\nAI analyzes data, models fire spread, and locates trapped individuals.\n\nData is transmitted in real time to assist command center planning."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:4259",
        "text": "Analyze fire source and select the appropriate extinguishing method (dry powder, CO₂, or water), then dispatch suitable drones.\n\nDispense fire extinguishing agents at AI-calculated points and quantities.\n\nMonitor firefighting effectiveness in real time and adjust strategies dynamically."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:4260",
        "text": "Small drones navigate narrow areas to detect vital signs and deliver rescue equipment to trapped individuals.\n\nEstablish a temporary communication network to support rescue command and coordination."
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "set_text_content",
      "success": true,
      "result": {
        "id": "1:4261",
        "text": "Conduct secondary reconnaissance to evaluate firefighting effectiveness and identify remaining risks.\n\nArchive data for subsequent analysis and improvement."
      }
    }
  ],
